WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.328
What if AI

00:00:01.152 --> 00:00:02.366
agents never re-read

00:00:02.178 --> 00:00:02.967
context

00:00:03.486 --> 00:00:04.960
Ramp Labs introduced

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:06.056
speculative encoding

00:00:06.257 --> 00:00:08.085
a single 2.35

00:00:07.896 --> 00:00:09.394
billion parameter mixture

00:00:09.205 --> 00:00:10.408
of experts model

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:11.752
that translates between

00:00:11.564 --> 00:00:12.778
different models' hidden

00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:13.320
states

00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:14.895
One model reads

00:00:14.707 --> 00:00:15.744
a long document

00:00:15.556 --> 00:00:16.121
once

00:00:16.181 --> 00:00:17.301
and the translator

00:00:17.112 --> 00:00:18.409
hands its understanding

00:00:18.221 --> 00:00:19.223
to other models

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.015
so multi-agent swarms

00:00:20.827 --> 00:00:21.735
skip reading the

00:00:21.546 --> 00:00:23.126
same context again

00:00:23.654 --> 00:00:24.998
Across seven models

00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:27.179
it keeps 96.9 percent

00:00:26.991 --> 00:00:28.253
of base accuracy

00:00:28.076 --> 00:00:29.279
and cuts prefill

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:30.128
latency by up

00:00:29.939 --> 00:00:31.000
to seven and

00:00:30.812 --> 00:00:31.743
a half times

00:00:31.555 --> 00:00:32.852
on long documents

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:34.404
Full story on

00:00:34.215 --> 00:00:35.111
the dashboard
